          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Dispensed from the revenues of Mu\u1e25arram</li>\n<li>\"the Beloved\" 3</li>\n<li>b. al-Ma\u1e6dar\u012b 1 1/2</li>\n<li>the teacher from Mal\u012bj 1 1/2</li>\n<li>\u02bfAbd All\u0101h who (lives) in the (synagogue of the) Iraqis 2</li>\n<li>Abu'l-\u1e24asan ibn Abu'l-Rukub 1 1/2</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Sa\u02bfd the cantor, son of the female teacher 3</li>\n<li>R. Shemarya the teacher 3</li>\n<li>[Ab\u016b] Na\u1e63r of Mal\u012bj, through \"the Chosen\" 3</li>\n<li>[...] the blind man 2</li></ol>\n",
